1
00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:03.336
Congratulations on completing this course.

2
00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:08.336
In this course, you'll learn
that DSPy is a lightweight flexible GenAI authoring

3
00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:13.179
framework that simplifies interaction
with LLMs and agent development.

4
00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:18.451
It also provides automatic program
optimization through DSPy optimizers,

5
00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:22.789
and it has native MLflow tracing
integration for easy development.

6
00:00:23.423 --> 00:00:27.193
You used dspy.signature
to define inputs and outputs,

7
00:00:27.761 --> 00:00:30.764
and DSPy.module
to wrap the custom logic.

8
00:00:31.164 --> 00:00:34.768
After building the program, you'll learn
how to prepare a small dataset

9
00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:36.469
and a metric function

10
00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:40.340
to use a DSPy optimizer to improve
the quality of the AI program.

11
00:00:40.807 --> 00:00:43.543
And then finally you used Mlflow tracing by

12
00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:46.446
adding mlflow.dspy.autolog.

13
00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:48.948
I'm looking forward to seeing
what you have built on your own!

